step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Go speak to <col=800000>Martin Holt</col> east of the <col=800000>Kourend Castle</col> and start the quest.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Go speak to Martin Holt east of the Kourend Castle and start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the ground floor of the Kourend Castle and speak to <col=800000>Commander Fullore</col>. A short cutscene will occur.</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Go speak to Martin Holt east of the Kourend Castle and start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the ground floor of the Kourend Castle and speak to Commander Fullore. A short cutscene will occur.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Once the cutscene is over, you will be south of a little house that you will need to investigate.</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Go speak to Martin Holt east of the Kourend Castle and start the quest.</str>
