line	<str>Go to the Graveyard of Heroes in Shayzien and go to the south of the church. Talk to Jorra and kill the level 132 assassin that spawns (he attacks with melee and ranged). Speak to Jorra again to receive the declaration.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Arceuus church (get the dark essence block beforehand if you don't already have it), climb up either of the two staircases, run all the way east, climb the stairs, and then talk to Mori. Bring her molten glass and dark essence block. She will give you a dark nullifier.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Chasm of Fire (north-west of fairy ring DJR). Try to go inside and complete the dialogue.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go to the <col=800000>Hosidius Vinery</col> (fairy ring AKR) and inspect the eastern Wine barrel (west of the fairy ring). Go inside and picklock the chest to get a <col=800000>Shayzien journal</col>.</col>
step	61	-	Quick guide step 61
line	<str>Go speak to Martin Holt east of the Kourend Castle and start the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the ground floor of the Kourend Castle and speak to Commander Fullore. A short cutscene will occur.</str>
line	
line	<str>Once the cutscene is over, you will be south of a little house that you will need to investigate.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go in the house, go up the stairs, and search the drawers in the eastern room. Read the receipt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go down the stairs and talk to Tomas Lawry by the roses .</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Lovakengj pub north-west of the Kourend Castle and speak to Fuggy.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Veos's boat in the south-eastern corner of Port Piscarilius and talk to Cabin Boy Herbert close to the quest and travel marker. A short cutscene will occur.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cutscene you will need to defeat the level 168 demon Judge of Yama. Dodge the fire waves like Galvek by standing away from the fire and running to the boss to melee him. He will have protect from magic & protect from missiles overhead during the entire fight.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the boss has been killed a cutscene inside Kourend Castle will occur.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-west to speak to Commander Fullore outside of the castle after the cutscene. She will be standing just south of the castle, directly north of the Shayzien mine.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Martin Holt again a bit east of Kourend Castle entrance where you started the quest.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the ground floor of the Arceuus Library and Right-click teleport on Archeio.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pickpocket Istoria for a Bluish key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the pink display case in the south-east corner of the room to retrieve Rose's diary.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back and speak to Martin Holt again with Rose's Diary. A note will fall out of the diary.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the note and speak to Martin again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Forthos Ruins, north-east of Woodcutting guild.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Martin Holt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the Stone Piles around the ruins to find a combination of numbers for the panel. Take note of these (unique to each player).</str>
line	
line	<str>Cut the vines to the west, squeeze-through the vines, and use the unique combination for 'ROSE' on the panel on the wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the note then show it to Martin Holt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Settlement Ruins, south-west of Wintertodt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Martin Holt in the north-west building after running past the Ice Spiders, Ice Giants, and Ice Wolves.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the assassin that spawns.</str>
line	
line	<str>Cast fire bolt (or above) on the ice chunks south-west of Martin, search the melted ice chunk and open the panel on the western wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the note and speak to Martin.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to The Legless Faun, in southern Piscarilius, on land, speak to Martin and climb the southern pillar.</str>
line	
line	<str>Check the panel upstairs. Note the order of each house.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back down the wall and push the statue panels on the statues in the order specified from the panel.</str>
line	
line	<str>Check the panel upstairs again.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cutscene, read the note.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the shack north-east of the farming guild, directly west of fairy ring CIR, and search the bed.</str>
line	
line	<str>Read the tatty note, then inspect the crates in the north-western corner and climb down the trap door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the shack and go south to Molch.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go east to the furthest dwelling in Molch and enter the Lizard dwelling.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north and talk to Kaht B'alam.</str>
line	
line	<str>Exit the temple by jumping in the hole to the west.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-west into the Kebos Swamp and cross the stone bridge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the south-eastern Lizardman eggs, and you will be attacked by a level 75 lizardman brute. You do not need to kill it.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back into the temple and give the Lizardman egg to Khat B'alam for the key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the door that is located on the north wall of the main corridor, south-west of Khat B'alam. The door is indicated by a keyhole on the wall.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill the spirit boss Xamphur.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the northern table in the lab.</str>
line	
line	<str>Return to the shack north-east of the farming guild, directly west of fairy ring CIR, and go downstairs by inspecting the crates again.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cut-scene, go and talk with:</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Xeric's Lookout and talk to Commander Fullore (Xeric's talisman - 1. Xeric's Lookout)</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cut-scene, speak with Commander Fullore again then talk with all 5 Lords again. They are on different floors of the lookout house, including the basement. Lord Arceuus is just outside (make sure you receive the broken redirector from him).</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Commander Fullore at the Lookout and ask about Lady Lovakengj.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Mount Karuulm, go down the elevator, and speak with Kaal-Mej-San.</str>
line	
line	<str>Create a sulphur potion (mix a defence potion with volcanic sulphur).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak with Kaal-Mej-San again. They will enchant the sulphur potion into a shielding potion.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Doors of Dinh at the Wintertodt Camp and pour the potion onto them.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Barbarian camp in the Kourend Woodland (south-east of the Rada's blessing teleport), and go down the ladder to the south.</str>
line	
line	<str>A level 91 Barbarian Warlord will attack you. Kill him, and then talk to Phileas Rimor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the prison just outside the Shayzien wall, west of the Graveyard of Heroes, and go down the staircase. (Kharedst's memoirs - History and Hearsay (Shayzien), then west down into a dungeon icon on the map)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Martin Holt.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Graveyard of Heroes in Shayzien and go to the south of the church. Talk to Jorra and kill the level 132 assassin that spawns (he attacks with melee and ranged). Speak to Jorra again to receive the declaration.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Arceuus church (get the dark essence block beforehand if you don't already have it), climb up either of the two staircases, run all the way east, climb the stairs, and then talk to Mori. Bring her molten glass and dark essence block. She will give you a dark nullifier.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Chasm of Fire (north-west of fairy ring DJR). Try to go inside and complete the dialogue.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Hosidius Vinery (fairy ring AKR) and inspect the eastern Wine barrel (west of the fairy ring). Go inside and picklock the chest to get a Shayzien journal.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Go back to <col=800000>Xeric's Lookout</col> and talk to all five of the lords.</col>
